{"seq":3,"slug":"clinical-practice","title":"第三章 兽医临床诊疗","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clinical-examination-diagnosis","title":"大学兽医学 — 临床检查与诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice/clinical-examination-diagnosis","wordCount":1884,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-surgical-treatment","title":"大学兽医学 — 内科与外科治疗","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice/medical-surgical-treatment","wordCount":1856,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"anesthesia-pharmacology","title":"大学兽医学 — 麻醉与兽医药理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice/anesthesia-pharmacology","wordCount":1986,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 第三章 兽医临床诊疗\n\n这是兽医学最贴近\"看病\"本身的一章。临床诊疗是把前两章的解剖、生理、病理知识综合运用到一个具体病例上的过程——从问诊、体检到下诊断，再到制定治疗方案。\n\n本章按照真实就诊流程展开：先讲临床检查与诊断的方法学（体征、影像、化验如何配合），再进入内科与外科治疗的基本原则，最后讨论麻醉与药物使用这一既关乎疗效又关乎动物安全的关键环节。\n"}